  "content_blocks": [
    {
      "block_id": "b00000",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Supply chain visibility",
      "ordinal": 0,
      "heading_path": [
        "Supply chain visibility"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00001",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In: Plan > Strategy and plan",
      "ordinal": 1,
      "heading_path": [
        "Supply chain visibility"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "ordinal": 2,
      "heading_path": [
        "Supply chain visibility",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00003",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This PPN applies to all central government departments, their executive agencies and non-departmental public bodies (collectively referred to as 'in-scope organisations'). In the case of procurements with an annual contract value over £5 million (based on advertised contract value, averaged over the life of the contract) which are subject to the Public Contracts Regulations 2015 (PCR 2015), in-scope organisations must, where it is relevant and proportionate to the contract subject-matter to do so, require the successful supplier through contractual conditions to:",
      "ordinal": 3,
      "heading_path": [
        "Supply chain visibility",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00004",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "a) advertise on Contracts Finder all subcontract opportunities, arising from that contract, above a minimum subcontract threshold of £25,000",
      "ordinal": 4,
      "heading_path": [
        "Supply chain visibility",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00005",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "b) report on subcontracting spend, and separately how much spend is directly with small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) or voluntary, community and social enterprise (VCSE) organisations in the delivery of the contract.",
      "ordinal": 5,
      "heading_path": [
        "Supply chain visibility",
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00006",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Objective at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 6,
      "heading_path": [
        "Supply chain visibility",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00007",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In relation to contracts within scope of this PPN, and where it is relevant and proportionate to do so, contractual clauses must be included requiring the supplier to whom the contract is awarded to advertise on Contracts Finder all subcontracting opportunities above a minimum subcontract threshold of £25,000, and to report their spend on subcontracting and direct spend with SMEs or VCSEs in the delivery of the contract.",
      "ordinal": 7,
      "heading_path": [
        "Supply chain visibility",
        "Objective at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00008",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Key considerations at this commercial stage",
      "ordinal": 8,
      "heading_path": [
        "Supply chain visibility",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00009",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "In-scope organisations should, for contracts within scope of this PPN, and where it is relevant and proportionate to the subject-matter of the contract to do so:",
      "ordinal": 9,
      "heading_path": [
        "Supply chain visibility",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00010",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "take into account contractual terms requiring subcontracting opportunities, above a minimum subcontract threshold of £25,000, to be advertised on Contracts Finder (noting that a higher threshold, not exceeding £100,000, can be set if the minimum threshold of £25,000 is considered to be overly burdensome to suppliers on a particular procurement)",
      "ordinal": 10,
      "heading_path": [
        "Supply chain visibility",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00011",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "consider requiring successful suppliers to report on subcontracting spend and how much of this spend is directly with SMEs or VCSEs in the delivery of the contract.",
      "ordinal": 11,
      "heading_path": [
        "Supply chain visibility",
        "Key considerations at this commercial stage"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00012",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Legal framework",
      "ordinal": 12,
      "heading_path": [
        "Supply chain visibility",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00013",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "This PPN should be read alongside the relevant parts of the legal framework but it is not designed to provide guidance on a particular clause or regulation from the PCR 2015.",
      "ordinal": 13,
      "heading_path": [
        "Supply chain visibility",
        "Legal framework"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00014",
      "block_type": "heading",
      "text": "Additional support and guidance",
      "ordinal": 14,
      "heading_path": [
        "Supply chain visibility",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00015",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Make sure you:",
      "ordinal": 15,
      "heading_path": [
        "Supply chain visibility",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00016",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "read the PPN and any supporting implementation guidance",
      "ordinal": 16,
      "heading_path": [
        "Supply chain visibility",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
      "block_id": "b00017",
      "block_type": "li",
      "text": "seek legal and commercial advice in the context of specific procurements",
      "ordinal": 17,
      "heading_path": [
        "Supply chain visibility",
        "Additional support and guidance"
      ],
      "source_locator": null,
      "metadata": {}
    },
    {
